  "primary": "A projectile flies where you look and strikes the first target. Effects:\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ fire (fire ×0.5 on wet)\n• Heat: sets on fire for 6 s (wet targets just dry off), thaws; melts ice and burns roots\n• Cold 40: extinguishes and slows, freezes for 4 s at 100 built-up cold (×2.5 on wet); puddles freeze\n• If the target is frozen or brittle: damage 4.75 ❤ thermal\n• Heals 1 ❤\n• Regeneration: +0.5 ❤ every 2 s for 6 s\n• Growth: up to 2 nearby blocks — crops +2 stages, dirt turns to grass, roots grow upward\n• Stone skin (Resistance I) for 4 s\n• Withering: −0.5 ❤ per second for 4 s\n• Life drain: 0.5 ❤ damage, you heal 0.2 ❤",
